        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Danny Carey, Adam Jones, Maynard James Keenan\n- Organizations: Man or Astro-man?, Tool\n- Places: Auburn, Alabama\n- Products: The Sounds of Tomorrow\n- Companies: Estrus Records\n- Topics: surf rock\n\nFacts:\n- Man or Astro-man? is a surf rock group that formed in Auburn, Alabama, in the early 1990s.\n- Tool formed in 1990.\n- Tool's line-up includes drummer Danny Carey, guitarist Adam Jones, and vocalist Maynard James Keenan.\n- Man or Astro-man? came to prominence over the 1990s.\n- The Sounds of Tomorrow is a 7-inch EP that Estrus Records released in 1996.",
